          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शब्द (shabda) is Sanskrit śabda, \"articulate sound, noise\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 12298). Marathi uses it for \"a word\"."
