              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खेळ (kheḷ) is inherited from a reconstructed khēl-, \"play\" (CDIAL 3918), the word inside खेळणे, \"to play\". CDIAL links it with Sanskrit krīḍati, \"plays\": if that verb has a non-Aryan source, these forms may share it."
